    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a stake-gunning companion to brand new music by Cork, Ireland-based band, Dankenstoned's Bongster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a centuries-long conspiracy\u00a0that sees the most powerful institutions in Cork City overtaken by a vampiric menace, hell-bent on creating a HUMAN MEGAZORD...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight supernatural enemies in three lovingly detailed arenas based on three much loved Cork City locations:\u00a0The Corner House, the Freemason's Lodge and St. Fin Barre's Cathedral.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your iconic stake gun, pin all  who oppose you STRAIGHT TO THE WALL with physics-based ragdolling reminiscent of the penetrator in F.E.A.R., the stake gun in Painkiller and the harpoon in Bioshock 2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to beat your personal high score while still making it out alive, in an engaging story mode with epic arena sections. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Paul, Arty, Mike or Dan, with full retro FPS level one-liner voice acting for each band member.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supercharge your fighting spirit with the fully original and unreleased soundtrack from\u00a0Dankenstoned's Bongster, including ambient tracks.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a stake-gunning companion to brand new music by Cork, Ireland-based band, Dankenstoned's Bongster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a centuries-long conspiracy\u00a0that sees the most powerful institutions in Cork City overtaken by a vampiric menace, hell-bent on creating a HUMAN MEGAZORD...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight supernatural enemies in three lovingly detailed arenas based on three much loved Cork City locations:\u00a0The Corner House, the Freemason's Lodge and St. Fin Barre's Cathedral.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your iconic stake gun, pin all  who oppose you STRAIGHT TO THE WALL with physics-based ragdolling reminiscent of the penetrator in F.E.A.R., the stake gun in Painkiller and the harpoon in Bioshock 2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to beat your personal high score while still making it out alive, in an engaging story mode with epic arena sections. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Paul, Arty, Mike or Dan, with full retro FPS level one-liner voice acting for each band member.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supercharge your fighting spirit with the fully original and unreleased soundtrack from\u00a0Dankenstoned's Bongster, including ambient tracks.</p></li></ul>",
